WEBVTT

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:30.319
(vicheko)

00:03:31.454 --> 00:03:35.816
mazao kutoka maduka makubwa
yanavunwa kabla hayajaiva

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:39.699
ili kusafiri zaidi ya maili elfu moja
kabla ya kufikishwa dukani

00:03:39.723 --> 00:03:41.478
kama wiki mbili hivi baadae

00:03:41.502 --> 00:03:43.797
mbadala wa hali hii, ni kwa kuwa
masoko mengi ya wakulima


00:03:43.821 --> 00:03:46.622
yako karibu na maeneo ya uzalishaji,

00:03:46.646 --> 00:03:51.380
wakulima wanasafiri chini maili 50
kukupatia mazao ya eneo husika


00:03:51.404 --> 00:03:53.780
bila uharibifu mwingi wa vifungashio

00:03:54.363 --> 00:03:59.052
kukiwa na ongezeko la wanunuzi mtandaoni
na vyakula vilivyoandaliwa kabla

00:03:59.076 --> 00:04:01.603
wateja wanazidi kutohusiana